WEBVTT

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.720
I don't understand. What is this?

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.960
We still don't have a report.

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:12.150
Once she enters the capital, 
we can't act easily.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:13.990
We ought to make a move before that.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:16.850
Erecpyle is the most 
skilled in our sorority.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.430
Why hasn't he settled this matter yet?

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:22.500
I hear that she is only 
traveling with two attendants.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:26.990
Rumor has it that there 
is a Hyperion with her.

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:28.000
What?!

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.010
Is it that man from the Aldoria knights?

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:35.110
No, apparently a mysterious human

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:36.730
has recently joined them.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.010
He was sighted wielding Alma Gear.

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:44.160
Unbelievable, a Hyperion 
under Ecarlate...

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:48.520
Then it makes sense that it's 
taking longer than just a day.

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:49.940
Wait.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.610
Who is this new attendant of hers?

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:54.780
I expect you looked into this.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:01:00.370
Of course, but we haven't 
found anything noteworthy yet.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:02.040
Send reinforcements to Erecpyle!

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:06.490
Please wait. Erec-sama 
is a very upstanding man.

00:01:06.490 --> 00:01:08.110
At times, however,

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:10.600
it might be beneficial 
to stay in the shadows.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:11.590
What do you mean?

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:30.940
Georg.

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:38.940
Priest, please give me some meat!

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:42.800
Soft meat! Light peach-colored 
meat encasing a thin bone!

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:44.840
I want to stab it over and over,

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:47.410
gut it, shave it, and enjoy the screams!

00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:48.960
How about some hard meat?

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:51.700
Thick bones, heavy bones, 
anything will do.

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:54.850
I'll break them, slice them, crush them!

00:01:54.850 --> 00:01:56.430
All right, then come out.

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:09.530
How many pieces of meat are there?

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:14.290
Four. Two pieces that 
smell like flowers,

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:15.730
two that smell like grass.

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:17.090
That sounds good.

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:20.220
You must prepare 
the most tender meat

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:23.300
that smells like flowers without fail.

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:26.270
Be careful with the meat 
that smells like grass.

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:28.590
I know!

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:31.510
I want to taste it already!

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:35.640
Soft meat is my favorite!

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:13.440
So you said that we'll find

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:14.870
a way for me to get back to my world

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:16.520
when we get to the capital, right?

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:19.080
How often are you going 
to ask the same thing?

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:21.350
All we said is that 
there's a possibility.

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:23.490
But there's a possibility, right?

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:26.510
You fell from the sky, right?

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:28.830
So you might be from Olvidia.

00:04:29.010 --> 00:04:31.940
Ah, that "Castle in the Sky" 
that you mentioned before.

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:33.890
But thinking about it,

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:36.790
why go to the capital when Ol... Ol...

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:38.170
Olvidia.

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.920
Wouldn't going to Olvidia 
directly make more sense?

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:43.700
Olvidia is high up in the skies.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:46.680
At the moment we have 
no way to get up there.

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:49.860
So that's why we have 
to go to the capital.

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:52.040
Living in the boonies isn't easy, huh?

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:54.130
You understood that 
surprisingly quickly.

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:55.520
You can keep your comments to yourself!

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.080
But then it's easy.

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:00.480
We go to the capital, we get 
to the castle in the sky,

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.200
and talk to the, the...

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:03.320
The Ixion.

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:05.760
I'll talk to the Ixion 
directly and have them

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:07.680
send me back to my own world.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:10.520
Then my normal life will be back!

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:11.870
That's all I have to do, huh?

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:13.980
Don't forget that you have duties

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.660
as my knight before that, underling.

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:17.110
You know, you ought to reward

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:18.830
your servants once in a while!

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:30.510
Image of Olvidia

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:30.990
All right, if I can only 
get back to my own world,

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:30.510
Bals

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:34.340
I can finally stop being a virgin.

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:36.480
So how many more days until 
we get to the capital?

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:39.980
Let's see, if nothing gets in our way,

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:42.190
about two months.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:44.620
That's wicked far!

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:45.920
Are you serious?

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:48.280
Isn't there a faster way?

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.570
Warp or Zoom, or a Midnight Bus?

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:53.080
We have to conduct our journey covertly.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.080
Our hands are tied.

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:59.430
Ah man, why did this have to happen?

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:01.430
Kon,

00:06:02.930 --> 00:06:04.340
you might not be able to tell,

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:05.830
but the princess is counting on you.

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:08.590
Please protect her until 
we get to the capital.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.100
Yeah, I know.

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:16.850
Sainglain!

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:19.140
What's wrong?

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:21.210
The princess is acting weird.

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:23.790
R-Really?

00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:25.150
I fear...

00:06:25.970 --> 00:06:27.400
Weird? Is she sick?

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:30.430
Can you please check, just to be sure?

00:06:30.430 --> 00:06:32.410
I mean, it could potentially be...

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:34.160
All right.

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:38.410
Huh? What's going on? Hey!

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:43.330
May we come in?

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:51.470
P-Princess...

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:54.600
What's going on? Looks like she's norma—

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:57.120
Excuse our intrusion!

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:04.990
What did you do that for? I almost died!

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:07.620
I'm sure that was...

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:11.840
But not yet, it's not 
quite that time yet.

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:14.750
What's wrong with you two?

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:15.720
Didn't you see?

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:16.500
See what?

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:17.640
The princess's thing.

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:18.650
What thing?

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:19.680
The thing.

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:22.960
I'm asking you what you 
mean by the thing!

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:24.530
If you just keep saying thing, thing,

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:26.540
it'll lead to Gestaltzerfall 
of my thing!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.430
You saw that one thing 
on her head, right?

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:34.800
Thing on her head?

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:41.350
What? The cowlick?

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:45.860
So in your world, they call 
that great sign "cowlick"?

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:49.310
I'm sorta confused that you're 
taking cowlicks so seriously.

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:51.680
Anyway, what is this great 
sign you're talking about?

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:53.310
The St. Piria family,

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:56.830
the royal family, have 
a hyperactivity period.

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.480
Hyperactivity period?

00:07:58.960 --> 00:07:59.910
Marian!

00:08:00.610 --> 00:08:01.650
Y-Yes!

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:03.130
I'm a little peckish.

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:07.540
Understood. I will bring 
you something shortly!

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:10.130
Um...

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:15.160
I guess kidney pie, pudding, pork 
rillettes, goat milk bavarois,

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:18.940
gooseberry tarte, grilled 
chicken, sea bass pate,

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:21.260
sauerkraut, boudin noir,

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:24.400
and blue neck goose confit 
are all we could make.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.860
What are we going to do? 
This isn't even close to enough.

00:08:27.550 --> 00:08:30.480
Wh-What are you doing in our kitchen?!

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.890
Owner! We have money!

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:35.670
While we're at it, we're going 
to rent out the whole inn.

00:08:35.670 --> 00:08:37.920
Don't take more guests, 
it's too dangerous.

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:41.160
Kon, please go shopping with Sainglain.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.200
What?

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:45.120
We have all that food, that's enough.

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:46.750
Go already!

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.270
Yes!

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:49.770
Kon, hurry up.

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:51.420
Wait up!

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:01.890
Thank you!

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.810
Hurry up, I'll leave you here.

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:11.890
Seriously?!

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:15.410
C-Come on!

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:23.020
Kon, I need to tell you something.

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:24.830
Do not talk back to the princess.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:26.940
Don't let her get agitated. 
Just let everything slide.

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:27.960
Every single thing.

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:30.460
We don't know what could trigger her.

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:31.770
Why?

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:34.650
Will she throw money 
away when she's grouchy?

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:36.970
But "we have money," right?

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:40.000
To be honest, I've never seen her

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.400
in her hyperactivity period either.

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:44.760
I've just heard stories.

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:46.350
What are you talking about?

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:48.500
Just be careful.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:51.110
When three cowlicks are standing up...

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:52.610
Then what?

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:56.060
It's over.

00:10:06.550 --> 00:10:07.580
We're back.

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:09.880
Take those things there to her!

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:11.380
Come on, now!

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:16.320
Let's go, Kon!

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:23.640
It took longer than expected.

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:28.760
Sorry for making you wait.

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:32.740
I'd like something a bit richer.

00:10:32.740 --> 00:10:34.530
I feel like I haven't 
eaten anything yet.

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.540
All right, I'll tell her.

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:41.280
We just put them down, right? 
They weren't empty, right?!

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:42.370
Kon, hurry.

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:50.950
Damn it, my fingers are numb.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.050
I can't let that stop me!

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:04.850
Wait a sec. This is weird! Really weird!

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:05.950
Where is that stuff going?

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:08.240
Why did this go all sci-fi on us?

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:09.790
Like there's a black hole 
in her stomach or something?

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:11.020
Hey, Kon!

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:12.300
Sainglain...

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:13.900
Yes? What can I do for you?

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:26.000
About the way you talk...

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.820
I think you should 
speak more courteously,

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:32.790
so I want you to end your 
sentences with "meow."

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:38.100
<i>Meow? What does that mean?</i>

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:40.560
<i>Is she telling me to be stupid?</i>

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:41.730
<i>No, stupid is still okay.</i>

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:43.080
<i>But "meow"?</i>

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:45.280
<i>Not only did I graduate 
from the university</i>

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:46.970
<i>in the capital of the empire,</i>

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.940
<i>I was also a member of 
the Aldoria Knights.</i>

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:51.880
<i>But if I refuse here...</i>

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:59.850
Understood.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:02.820
Meow.

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:03.850
All right.

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:05.370
You said meow!

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.080
And Pet.

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:09.080
You're a bird.

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:21.370
You can fly?!

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:29.450
Spit roast, spit roast...

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:34.690
Pork on a spit...

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:41.140
Are you all right?! Meow. Marian...

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:43.060
The dessert isn't done yet.

00:12:43.060 --> 00:12:45.200
I also have to prepare 
stuff for tomorrow.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:46.840
Don't overdo it, meow.

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:49.070
But the princess is already at two.

00:12:49.070 --> 00:12:50.580
We don't have any buffer.

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:54.970
How pathetic.

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:57.730
What are you so scared of?

00:12:57.730 --> 00:13:00.170
This is just a child being spoiled.

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:02.070
She's basically just got some 
children's bug or something.

00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:03.390
What are you saying, meow?

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:05.300
I'll go set her straight.

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:08.070
P-Please stop. Stop! Kon!

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:09.180
Don't do it, meow!

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:13.060
It's fine. You guys just worry too much.

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:20.690
Princess, I'm coming in.

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:25.450
You really ate all that?

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:30.070
I guess you're going 
through a growth spurt.

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:33.860
I can understand being so 
hungry that it's unbearable,

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:36.580
but don't be too unreasonable 
with Marian and Sainglain.

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:40.070
That money wasn't money 
you earned, right?

00:13:40.070 --> 00:13:41.840
Being wasteful isn't good, you know?

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:45.840
Right?

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:52.440
As long as you understand.

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:54.350
Let's bring the dishes down together.

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:03.270
Th-Thank you, meow.

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:03.270
Thank you.

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:09.180
You're going to bed? Good night.

00:14:12.310 --> 00:14:14.730
See, like I said,

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:16.280
you just have to talk to her.

00:14:16.280 --> 00:14:18.080
Kon, what are you doing?!

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:20.120
Do you realized that 
you could have died?!

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:22.130
Marian is right, meow!

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:25.260
Courage that disregards 
situation and standing

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:27.130
is called recklessness, meow!

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:29.180
You guys are overthinking this.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:30.810
Actually, you're coddling her.

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:33.950
We're in this together. We're a party.

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:37.010
A relationship where the 
majority have to bear something

00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:39.140
for the sake of one individual 
will never last long.

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:43.760
So you've done enough. 
Everything's over.

00:14:43.760 --> 00:14:47.220
Now let the goddess called 
sleep embrace you.

00:14:58.490 --> 00:15:01.880
They're finally asleep. 
I've been waiting forever.

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:06.470
How am I going to begin?

00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:10.970
Stab? Break? Slice?

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:27.050
Someone's still awake?

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:28.930
It'd be bad if they woke everybody.

00:15:28.930 --> 00:15:30.490
Best take care of them now.

00:15:36.650 --> 00:15:37.790
Don't get in my way!

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:45.750
I'll cut you up and turn 
you into a meat dish!

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:52.580
Ow! Hot! Hot!

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.360
The hell are you doing?!

00:16:05.180 --> 00:16:08.820
Do I look like I have time 
for this, you maggot?!

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:10.960
Are you screwing with me?

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:12.580
Our lives are on the line here.

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:14.870
A single bread roll at 
breakfast could cause

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:17.490
the destruction of this town 
or of the entire world!

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:22.370
Can a useless scumbag like you 
take responsibility for that?

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:25.420
If you don't know, crawl back into your

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:26.840
father's balls and think it over!

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:29.390
Actually, don't bother coming back.

00:16:29.390 --> 00:16:33.610
Go into a wad of tissue 
and stop existing!

00:16:33.610 --> 00:16:35.590
I-I'm sorry!

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:37.160
Bitch!

00:16:48.090 --> 00:16:50.220
That woman was creepy.

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:53.460
I should just go for 
the main prize first.

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:57.370
I bet she'll scream 
nicely and flail around!

00:17:04.780 --> 00:17:09.130
Oh man, why didn't you 
tell me you were here?

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:14.440
You shouldn't move too much.

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:17.000
Even if you're skilled, 
you do realize that

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:19.890
you won't get away unscathed, right?

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:24.390
<i>What is this?</i>

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:27.800
<i>He has no openings, but I sense 
no danger from him, either.</i>

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:29.800
<i>How is that possible?</i>

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:32.440
I'm saying this for your sake, meow.

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:35.450
You should leave immediately, meow.

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:37.200
What are you talking about?

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:38.700
Now, meow!

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:42.200
Stay away from me!

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:44.330
Wait, meow!

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:54.540
Oh, meow.

00:17:56.110 --> 00:17:56.680
Meow?

00:18:17.980 --> 00:18:21.380
So this is the princess's room.

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:27.640
Soft meat, thin bones.

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:30.750
I wonder how it will 
feel when I stab her.

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:51.800
Who the hell are you?!

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:53.220
My hands! It got on my hands!

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:56.130
M-M-Monster! Help me!

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:57.400
Knock it off!

00:19:02.670 --> 00:19:04.160
So who are you?

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:09.670
Ecarlate! Really scary! Coming! Angry!

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:11.250
Huh? What?

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:13.230
I told you! Help me!

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:15.170
Oh, the princess.

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:17.350
You're still doing that? That joke?

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:19.230
You even hired an extra?

00:19:19.230 --> 00:19:20.720
Enough already.

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:22.590
Pops, how much did they pay 
you for this silly act?

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:24.600
Ecarlate!

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:26.670
All right, all right.

00:19:26.670 --> 00:19:28.180
Why was this left open?

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:29.230
No!

00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:31.270
No...

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:35.020
Okay, okay. I get it.

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:37.180
Pops, your crying act is really good.

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:42.700
Princess...

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:46.450
Huh, she's not here?

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:50.140
Was that the wind?

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:51.840
Is the window open?

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:01.840
It's closed...

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:06.290
Pops?

00:20:07.340 --> 00:20:08.310
Hey!

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:13.270
Ew, what? It's slimy.

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:28.500
Who's there?

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:56.670
Help!

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:01.140
And thus the Ulga religious sorority's

00:21:01.140 --> 00:21:03.500
assassination attempt 
on St. Piria Empire's

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:05.470
Princess Ecarlate came to an end.

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:08.670
Fortunately for the sorority,

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:10.800
there were few who knew about the plan,

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:14.780
and even fewer who knew 
about its failure.

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:18.570
Ever since, nobody has seen

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:22.100
the mysterious assassin Georg again.

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:28.370
Gramps!

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:31.240
Oh, you're being bad again.

00:21:31.240 --> 00:21:34.890
I told you that you're not 
supposed to come here alone.

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:37.080
But you're here.

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:38.260
Yeah, yeah!

00:21:38.260 --> 00:21:42.510
The thing comes to the bad 
kids who don't listen.

00:21:42.510 --> 00:21:44.400
Thing? You mean...

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:50.170
Yes, the three-haired monster!

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:52.380
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:21:52.380 --> 00:21:54.050
We won't do it again!

00:23:32.600 --> 00:23:34.040
I'm bored.

00:23:34.590 --> 00:23:36.700
I wonder where Erec-sama went.

00:23:36.700 --> 00:23:37.980
Damn that Variation.

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:40.390
He snuck out on us 
and now he's with Erec-sama.

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:42.150
KT, are you jealous?

00:23:42.150 --> 00:23:43.540
D-Don't be ridiculous!

00:23:43.540 --> 00:23:44.890
Don't worry.

00:23:44.890 --> 00:23:46.650
Variation definitely 
does not swing that way.

00:23:46.650 --> 00:23:49.260
Yes, he's an ultra sadist.

00:23:49.260 --> 00:23:50.320
Is that true?!

00:23:50.320 --> 00:23:52.800
Variation the torture lover.

00:23:52.800 --> 00:23:55.530
Just recently he was torturing 
this empire spy and...

00:23:55.530 --> 00:23:56.140
I'm jealous...

00:23:56.140 --> 00:23:57.020
What?

00:23:56.380 --> 00:23:58.000
N-Nothing.

00:23:58.800 --> 00:24:01.630
I guess we have no choice 
but to go drinking.

00:24:01.630 --> 00:24:03.960
You always use any 
excuse to go drinking.

00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:06.530
Well, shall we go to a cabaret club?

00:24:06.530 --> 00:24:08.010
Hell no!

00:24:09.970 --> 00:24:24.900
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.450 --> 00:24:11.760
In order to treat my wounds,

00:24:11.760 --> 00:24:14.800
I've come to the 
Tamatsukure hot springs.

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:18.100
But fate would have it that 
I meet DT there again.

00:24:18.100 --> 00:24:19.510
Damn you, DT!

00:24:19.510 --> 00:24:21.990
I'm going to settle 
this once and for all!

00:24:21.990 --> 00:24:24.340
What? What is that glow?!

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:29.400
The Tamatsukure Hot Springs,  
where the gods congregate.

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:29.400
What is Erec trying to achieve here?

00:24:29.400 --> 00:24:35.600
Ah, so the mirror world 
has hot springs, too.

00:24:29.400 --> 00:24:35.600
The fantasy setting has 
just gone to yellow.
